# D1 — UI and Navigation Decisions

**Project:** StudyMatch  
**Owner:** Carlos  
**Status:** Preliminary approval.

## 1. Component library

**Decision: Material UI (MUI)** will be the project's only React component library. Do not add Mantine or another competing component library. Use a shared MUI theme and reusable components rather than styling each screen independently.

Use MUI components for navigation, buttons, inputs, tables, dialogs, alerts, progress indicators, and feedback. Use MUI icons consistently. Custom CSS is allowed for layout and specific visual details, but it must follow the shared design tokens.

## 2. Color palette

The visual style is clear, calm, and professional, suitable for teachers and students. The primary color is indigo; neutral greys carry most of the interface. Status colors are reserved for semantic feedback.

